---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout heroDark={true}
  title="Our Pastors"
  description="Meet Pastors George and Deborah Kamalu — the spiritual leaders of Jesus House Jamaica, an RCCG parish in Kingston, Jamaica dedicated to empowering men and women for godly living."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <span class="section-label">Our Shepherds</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Our Pastors</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Called, consecrated, and committed to leading Jesus House Jamaica with wisdom,
        integrity, and a heart for God's people.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-clip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Scripture Banner -->
  <section class="scripture-banner">
    <div class="container scripture-inner">
      <svg class="scripture-icon" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z" /><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z" />
      </svg>
      <blockquote class="scripture-text">
        "And I will give you pastors according to mine heart, which shall feed you with knowledge and understanding."
      </blockquote>
      <cite class="scripture-ref">— Jeremiah 3:15</cite>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pastors Feature -->
  <section class="pastors-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="pastors-grid">

        <!-- Pastor George Kamalu -->
        <article class="pastor-card">
          <div class="pastor-avatar" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="pastor-initials">G.K</span>
            <div class="avatar-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="pastor-info">
            <span class="section-label">Senior Pastor</span>
            <h2 class="pastor-name">Pastor George Kamalu</h2>
            <p class="pastor-role">Senior Pastor, Jesus House Jamaica</p>
            <div class="pastor-bio">
              <p>
                Pastor George Kamalu is the Senior Pastor of Jesus House Jamaica, one of the flagship
                parishes of the Redeemed Christian Church of God (RCCG) in the English-speaking Caribbean.
                A man of deep faith and unyielding conviction, Pastor George has dedicated his life to
                seeing the transforming power of the Gospel change lives across Jamaica and beyond.
              </p>
              <p>
                Under his leadership, Jesus House Jamaica has grown into a vibrant, Spirit-filled
                community that reaches out into every stratum of Jamaican society — from inner-city
                communities in Kingston to the corridors of academia and business. His ministry is
                marked by a powerful anointing for healing, a gift for expository preaching, and an
                unwavering commitment to integrity and excellence.
              </p>
              <p>
                Pastor George is also deeply committed to raising the next generation of leaders within
                the RCCG Caribbean network, regularly mentoring pastors and overseers across the region.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pastor-tags">
              <span class="tag">Preacher</span>
              <span class="tag">Mentor</span>
              <span class="tag">RCCG Leader</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Pastor Deborah Kamalu -->
        <article class="pastor-card pastor-card--reverse">
          <div class="pastor-avatar pastor-avatar--coral" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="pastor-initials">D.K</span>
            <div class="avatar-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="pastor-info">
            <span class="section-label">Co-Pastor</span>
            <h2 class="pastor-name">Pastor Deborah Kamalu</h2>
            <p class="pastor-role">Co-Pastor & Women's Ministry Lead</p>
            <div class="pastor-bio">
              <p>
                Pastor Deborah Kamalu serves as Co-Pastor alongside her husband, bringing a tender
                anointing for healing, intercession, and the empowerment of women. She is the driving
                force behind the Jesus House Women's Fellowship — a thriving ministry that equips women
                from all walks of life to live with purpose, strength, and godly character.
              </p>
              <p>
                Pastor Deborah's ministry is characterised by a gift for pastoral counselling and a
                profound sensitivity to the Holy Spirit. Her quarterly women's retreats have become
                a cornerstone of the church's calendar, drawing participants from across Jamaica and
                the wider Caribbean region.
              </p>
              <p>
                A teacher, encourager, and intercessor, Pastor Deborah embodies the church's theme of
                "Empowering men and women for godly living" — living it out daily in service to God
                and His people.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pastor-tags">
              <span class="tag">Counsellor</span>
              <span class="tag">Intercessor</span>
              <span class="tag">Women's Ministry</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RCCG Leadership Context -->
  <section class="context-section">
    <div class="container context-grid">
      <div class="context-text">
        <span class="section-label">RCCG Network</span>
        <h2 class="context-heading">Part of a Global Movement</h2>
        <p>
          Pastors George and Deborah Kamalu serve under the spiritual authority and oversight of the
          Redeemed Christian Church of God — one of the largest and most influential Pentecostal
          denominations in the world, with parishes in over 198 nations.
        </p>
        <p>
          The RCCG was founded in 1952 by the late Reverend Josiah Akindayomi in Lagos, Nigeria,
          and has grown under the visionary leadership of Pastor Enoch Adeboye into a global
          movement committed to making heaven and taking as many people as possible along.
        </p>
        <a href="/history-of-rccg" class="btn btn-outline-navy" style="margin-top:1.5rem; display:inline-flex;">
          Explore RCCG History
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="context-stats">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">198+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Nations with RCCG Presence</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">1952</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Year RCCG Was Founded</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">Jamaica</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Caribbean RCCG Hub</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">Romans 12:1</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Our Church Scripture</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Connect CTA -->
  <section class="connect-cta">
    <div class="container connect-inner">
      <h2 class="connect-heading">Connect With Our Leadership</h2>
      <p class="connect-sub">
        We believe in an open-door leadership. Come worship with us — Pastors George and
        Deborah would love to meet you and pray with you.
      </p>
      <div class="connect-btns">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get in Touch</a>
        <a href="/services" class="btn btn-outline-white">View Service Times</a>
      </div>
      <div class="connect-info">
        <div class="info-item">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" /><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" /></svg>
          <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=3+McGregor+Square,+corner+of+Beechwood+Avenue,+off+Halfway+Tree,+Kingston+5,+Jamaica" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">3 McGregor Square, Halfway Tree, Kingston 5, Jamaica</a>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 13a19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 3.6 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" /></svg>
          <a href="tel:+18769202260">+1 876 920 2260</a>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z" /><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6" /></svg>
          jesushousekgn@hotmail.com
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    background-color: var(--color-navy);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 9rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.1) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 80%, rgba(224, 90, 43, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .hero-clip {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 60px;
    background-color: var(--color-gold);
    opacity: 0.04;
    clip-path: polygon(0 100%, 100% 0, 100% 100%);
  }

  /* Scripture */
  .scripture-banner {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(13, 27, 62, 0.06);
  }

  .scripture-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .scripture-icon {
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }

  .scripture-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .scripture-ref {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Pastors */
  .pastors-section {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    padding: var(--section-padding) 0;
  }

  .pastors-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .pastor-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .pastor-card {
      grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
      gap: 3.5rem;
    }

    .pastor-card--reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 200px;
    }

    .pastor-card--reverse .pastor-avatar {
      order: 2;
    }

    .pastor-card--reverse .pastor-info {
      order: 1;
    }
  }

  .pastor-avatar {
    position: relative;
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-gold), #b8922e);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pastor-avatar--coral {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-coral), #c04820);
  }

  .avatar-ring {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.3);
  }

  .pastor-initials {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .pastor-name {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .pastor-role {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-coral);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pastor-bio p {
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pastor-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tag {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    background-color: rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 168, 67, 0.3);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
  }

  /* Context */
  .context-section {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    padding: var(--section-padding) 0;
  }

  .context-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .context-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .context-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .context-text p {
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .context-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .stat-card {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid rgba(13, 27, 62, 0.08);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .connect-cta {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-navy) 0%, #172040 100%);
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .connect-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .connect-heading {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .connect-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .connect-btns {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .connect-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .info-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  /* ── Mobile overrides ─────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    [class$="-hero"] {
      padding-top: 5.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }
  }

  .info-item svg {
    color: var(--color-gold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
</style>
